Context
    DocumentVersion: 0.11.1-draft
    GrammarVersion: 1.0.1

Module
    Type: Module
    Role: Content
    Caption: EmitNext — fallthrough emission (next in order)

    Function
        Type: Function
        Role: Content
        Name: EmitNext
        Params: state, b, bid
        Returns: state
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.MapGet
            Params: b, "instrs"
            Returns: instrs
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: EmitInstrs, state, instrs
            Returns: state
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Ctrl.Call
            Params: NextInOrder, state, bid
            Returns: nxt
        Instruction
            Type: Instruction
            Role: Content
            Op: Core.Eq
            Params: nxt, null
            Returns: isLast
        Branch
            Condition: isLast
            TrueBlock
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Core.MapGet
                    Params: b, "term"
                    Returns: term
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                    Params: EmitReturn, state, b, term
                    Returns: state
            FalseBlock
                Instruction
                    Type: Instruction
                    Role: Content
                    Op: Ctrl.Call
                    Params: EmitBlock, state, nxt
                    Returns: state
        Result
            Type: Result
            Role: Content
            State: Ok
            Returns: state